sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Cluster Admin / ODH
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Manager as mlflow-operator-controller-manager
    participant MLflowCtrl as MLflow Controller
    participant MLflowOpCtrl as MLflowOperator Controller
    participant NSCtrl as Namespace Controller
    participant SecWatcher as SecurityProfileWatcher
    participant HelmEngine as Helm Renderer<br/>(charts/mlflow)

    Note over Manager,SecWatcher: Startup Sequence

    Manager->>K8sAPI: Discovery: check CRD availability<br/>(ConsoleLink, HTTPRoute, ServiceMonitor, Auth, MLflowOperator)
    K8sAPI-->>Manager: CRD availability results
    Manager->>K8sAPI: GET apiservers.config.openshift.io/cluster<br/>Read TLS profile
    K8sAPI-->>Manager: TLS profile (Intermediate/Custom)
    Manager->>Manager: Configure metrics server TLS
    Manager->>Manager: Start controllers (conditional on CRD discovery)
    Manager->>SecWatcher: Start TLS profile watcher

    Note over Manager,HelmEngine: MLflow CR Reconciliation

    User->>K8sAPI: Create/Update MLflow CR
    K8sAPI->>MLflowCtrl: Watch event: MLflow CR changed
    MLflowCtrl->>K8sAPI: GET MLflow CR details
    K8sAPI-->>MLflowCtrl: MLflow spec
    MLflowCtrl->>K8sAPI: GET MLflowConfig (namespace override)
    K8sAPI-->>MLflowCtrl: MLflowConfig spec (if exists)
    MLflowCtrl->>K8sAPI: GET Secret mlflow-artifact-connection
    K8sAPI-->>MLflowCtrl: Artifact storage credentials
    MLflowCtrl->>HelmEngine: Render chart with values
    HelmEngine-->>MLflowCtrl: Rendered manifests
    MLflowCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployment, Service,<br/>Secret, SA, PVC, CronJob
    opt Gateway API CRD available
        MLflowCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HTTPRoute
    end
    opt ConsoleLink CRD available
        MLflowCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ConsoleLink
    end
    opt ServiceMonitor CRD available
        MLflowCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ServiceMonitor
    end
    MLflowCtrl->>K8sAPI: PATCH MLflow status

    Note over Manager,HelmEngine: MLflowOperator CR Reconciliation

    User->>K8sAPI: Create/Update MLflowOperator CR
    K8sAPI->>MLflowOpCtrl: Watch event: MLflowOperator CR changed
    MLflowOpCtrl->>K8sAPI: GET MLflowOperator CR
    K8sAPI-->>MLflowOpCtrl: MLflowOperator spec
    MLflowOpCtrl->>K8sAPI: Update MLflowOperator status

    Note over Manager,HelmEngine: Namespace RBAC Reconciliation

    K8sAPI->>NSCtrl: Watch event: Namespace changed
    NSCtrl->>K8sAPI: GET Auth CR (services.platform.opendatahub.io)
    K8sAPI-->>NSCtrl: Auth configuration
    NSCtrl->>K8sAPI: LIST MLflow CRs
    K8sAPI-->>NSCtrl: Active MLflow instances
    NSCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create/Update/Delete RoleBindings<br/>(view/edit per namespace)

    Note over Manager,SecWatcher: TLS Profile Monitoring

    SecWatcher->>K8sAPI: Watch apiservers.config.openshift.io/cluster
    K8sAPI-->>SecWatcher: TLS profile change detected
    SecWatcher->>Manager: Trigger operator restart

    Note over Manager: Metrics & Health

    participant Prometheus as Prometheus
    participant Kubelet as Kubelet

    Kubelet->>Manager: GET :8081/healthz (no auth)
    Manager-->>Kubelet: 200 OK
    Kubelet->>Manager: GET :8081/readyz (no auth)
    Manager-->>Kubelet: 200 OK
    Prometheus->>Manager: GET :8443/metrics<br/>HTTPS + TokenReview/SubjectAccessReview
    Manager-->>Prometheus: Metrics response
